exports[`what the page renders > says the same words as before the content was split 1`] = `"Skip to main contentRemigiuszBednarczykRBAboutExperienceSkillsCertificationsInitiativesCommunityContactResume (PDF)CV Hello World, my name isRemigiusz Bednarczyk.Quality engineering for high-risk systems.Quality engineering professional with 12+ years of experience in software testing and test leadership. I specialize in test management, quality engineering practices, and building testing processes for regulated environments such as pharmaceutical and GxP systems.12+Years Experience500+Testers Trained300+Technical Assessments Conducted10+GxP Projects DeliveredTest ManagementQuality EngineeringGxP / Computerised System ValidationTechnical AssessmentAIISTQBMentoringExplore ExperienceGet in Touch01. Core ExpertiseQuality Engineering LeadershipBuilding and scaling testing processes for complex and regulated environments.Test Strategy & Risk-Based TestingDesigning test approaches aligned with compliance, delivery pressure, and business priorities.GxP / CSV ValidationEnsuring software quality within validated pharmaceutical environments.Testing TransformationTransitioning organizations from manual or paper-based processes to modern digital QA workflows.Technical Assessment & MentoringEvaluating engineering talent and mentoring testers across all seniority levels.Pre-Sales & ConsultingSupporting discovery phases, solution design, and QA strategy for new engagements.02. About meMy journey in IT started over a decade ago. Today, my focus lies at the intersection of quality engineering, strategic risk management, and organizational transformation. I specialize in building robust testing processes that ensure the highest quality of software delivery for high-risk and regulated systems.I am deeply passionate about process optimization and cultivating a culture of quality within engineering teams. I believe that effective testing is not just a phase to find defects, but a continuous practice of building confidence in the product and the critical systems people depend on daily.Beyond technical strategy, my core focus is on people. I am dedicated to mentoring engineers, shaping QA talent, and elevating the standards of the testing community. Whether through designing comprehensive training programs or guiding organizations through digital transformations, my goal is to empower teams to deliver excellence.When I'm not evaluating test processes or managing projects, I am a happy father, a runner, and a kettlebell training enthusiast practicing the Hardstyle Kettlebell method developed by Pavel Tsatsouline."AI-first engineering shifts value from writing code to making decisions."03. Professional ExperienceTest ManagerSii Poland2021 - PresentLeading quality engineering and testing strategy across regulated pharmaceutical projects while also contributing to internal consulting, discovery phases, and QA offerings within the Sii Testing Competency Center.Contributed to discovery phases for new projects by assessing testing maturity, risks, and delivery models.Supported pre-sales activities, including solution design, testing strategy proposals, and estimation.Participated in the creation and evolution of testing offerings within the Sii Testing Competency Center.Took part in focus groups and internal initiatives shaping quality engineering practices across the organization.ConsultingPre-SalesDiscoveryQuality EngineeringTest StrategyTest Manager / GxP Projects2021 - PresentManaged testing teams across multiple concurrent GxP-regulated projects within a distributed international environment, collaborating daily with global cross-functional stakeholders (USA, Switzerland, UK, Malaysia).Ensured predictable delivery by owning end-to-end test management, including defining and approving Test Strategies and Test Plans aligned with business goals, regulatory requirements, and project constraints.Ensured testing compliance within a validated GxP/CSV environment, taking full accountability for testing activities, validation alignment, and formal documentation (RTMs, Release Test Plans, Test Reports).Established QA processes from scratch by conducting discovery phases, assessing existing workflows, and implementing governance, entry/exit criteria, and best practices.Successfully delivered and rolled out a digitalized testing and documentation process used across regulated IRT workflows, transitioning from paper-based to digital test documentation (Jira with Xray).Enabled regulatory compliance of the pharmaceutical supply chain by leading the implementation of the EU Module in TraceLink.Acted as Validation Lead, with decision authority over validation approach, documentation scope, and lifecycle coverage.Implemented time-optimizing solutions, such as Unscripted Testing and alternative automation approaches, to increase team efficiency under tight timelines.Resolved conflicts between delivery timelines, quality expectations, and compliance requirements by aligning multiple stakeholders across business, QA, and project management.Test ManagementRisk AnalysisProcess ImplementationDigital TransformationJiraXrayAgile/ScrumSAFeGxPCSVSenior Test & Analysis Engineer / AcxiomSii Poland2018 - 2021Conducted comprehensive API, GUI, and web services testing to ensure robust application functionality and seamless integration.Led cloud testing initiatives across AWS, HDFS, Hue, Kafka, Spark, Qubole, and S3, ensuring data integrity within Data Warehouses and Data Lakes.Analyzed business requirements to prepare detailed test documentation, including comprehensive test plans and test cases.Implemented and executed both manual and automated tests, continuously improving the test framework and introducing innovative testing strategies.Enhanced the regression test suite and integrated it into the Continuous Integration (CI) pipeline to accelerate delivery cycles.Validated complex data structures and performed extensive database testing using relational (Oracle, MSSQL, MySQL) and non-relational (NoSQL, MongoDB, Hadoop) databases.Collaborated within cross-functional, international teams (USA, UK, Poland) using UNIX/Linux environments and Git/SVN version control systems.API TestingCloud TestingBig DataTest AutomationCI/CDSQL / NoSQLAWSAgile/ScrumTest & Analysis Engineer / AcxiomSii Poland2017 - 2018Performed manual and automated testing for Data Warehouses and web services, ensuring data accuracy and system reliability.Created and maintained comprehensive test documentation, including test plans and test cases based on business requirements.Contributed to the continuous improvement of the test framework and integrated regression test suites into the CI pipeline.Executed database testing across relational (Oracle, MSSQL, MySQL) and non-relational (NoSQL, MongoDB, Hadoop) environments.Worked effectively within international, cross-functional teams utilizing UNIX/Linux systems and Git/SVN version control.Data WarehouseWeb ServicesTest AutomationSQL / NoSQLUNIX/LinuxAgile/ScrumApplication Tester / Simple S.A. (Bazus)Simple S.A.2014 - 2017Tested the Bazus ERP application dedicated to higher education institutions, ensuring system reliability across various modules and customer production environments.Actively participated in an Agile (Scrum) development team, contributing to release planning, test estimation, and SLA-driven backlog management.Performed end-to-end system, module, and operational testing, applying techniques like equivalence partitioning and boundary value analysis.Conducted build verification tests (BVT) and managed build releases via internal deployment systems to Git repositories within a Continuous Integration (CI) pipeline.Created and maintained manual test cases and automated testware using Selenium IDE, while comprehensively analyzing functional requirements.Developed and administered technical documentation using single-source publishing tools, and conducted internal training sessions for team members.Agile/ScrumSeleniumJenkinsGitRequirements AnalysisGUI TestingTechnical Documentation04. Key AchievementsDelivered digitalised testing and documentation process for regulated IRT workflowsLed testing across multiple concurrent GxP pharmaceutical projectsTrained over 500 software testers in QA practices and ISTQB preparationLed a technical assessment program evaluating testers from Junior to Test Manager levelContributed to the development of testing offerings within the Sii Testing Competency Center05. Awards & RecognitionLeague of Honor – The StarSii Poland2023Highest distinction awarded to top contributors shaping company growth and strategic direction.Top Gun – Leadership AwardSii Poland2022Recognized as a role model and impactful leader in the organization.Sii Star – Employee of the YearSii Poland2022Awarded for outstanding performance and measurable impactSii Star – Employee of the YearSii Poland2018Awarded for outstanding performance and measurable impact06. Technologies & SkillsQuality EngineeringTest StrategyRisk-based TestingQuality GovernanceTest Process DesignExploratory TestingRegulated SystemsComputerised System Validation (CSV)GxP EnvironmentsValidation DocumentationRequirements Traceability (RTM)Audit-ready TestingDelivery & LeadershipTest LeadershipStakeholder ManagementSAFe / Agile DeliveryITILAgilePMQuality Governance at ScaleTechnical & Data BackgroundAPI TestingSQL / Data ValidationETL & Data PipelinesFrontend TestingCI/CD AwarenessAI-assisted Testing07. Certifications & CredentialsProfessional CertificationsISTQB CTAL Test ManagerISTQB CTAL Technical Test AnalystISTQB CTFL Agile TesterISTQB CTFLISTQB Accredited Trainer (all above)Certified SAFe® 6 AgilistAgilePM® FoundationAI & Emerging TechAI_devs 3 AgentsFundamentals of Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning for IT Specialists and ManagersAdditional Training15+ technical courses (Pluralsight, Udemy) covering Java, CI/CD, Big Data, API testing08. Selected InitiativesSii TestingLab JuryParticipated as a jury member in a Sii TestingLab research initiative aimed at evaluating selected software testing solutions. Contributed to defining the study scope, designing the testing scenarios, and establishing evaluation criteria. Performed code reviews as part of the technical assessment and co-developed the final evaluation results and report.Code ReviewAI-driven testingQuality EngineeringPolish Testing Board (SJSI) Vice-PresidentAs Vice President of the Polish Testing Board, I contribute to the development and promotion of professional standards in software testing and quality assurance. I regularly host major industry conferences such as TestWarez and Na Podbój IT, helping facilitate discussions within the testing community.LeadershipISTQBSpeakerTestWarezNa Podbój IT!Lead Technical AssessorI lead an internal technical assessment program focused on evaluating the skills and seniority of software testing professionals. My role includes conducting technical interviews (from Junior Testers to Test Managers), managing a team of Technical Assessors, and continuously improving the assessment framework and knowledge base.Technical AssesmentQuality AssuranceISTQBLeadershipMentoringISTQB Training & MentoringConducting trainings and workshops for various clients such as Sii Poland and Testerzy.pl, while mentoring engineers in leadership, test management, and technical skills to raise their overall technical proficiency.TrainingMentoringISTQBWorkshopsTechnical Writer (QA & Engineering)Author and co-author of technical articles on software testing, data systems and QA practices, contributing to knowledge sharing across engineering teams.Technical WritingKnowledge SharingQA PracticesBrand AmbassadorFeatured as a Brand Ambassador in nationwide campaigns, including the #UnstoppableSii eco-murals project across major Polish cities. Selected as a company representative for the Great Place to Work campaign and official Sii Calendars, actively contributing to employer branding and organizational culture.Employer BrandingBrand Ambassador#UnstoppableSiiCommunity09. Community & LeadershipVice President of the Polish Testing Board (SJSI)Conference host and speaker at TestWarez and Na Podbój ITTrainer and mentor for 500+ software testersAuthor of technical articles on software testing and QA practicesLead Technical Assessor responsible for evaluating testing professionals10. Community & Brand PresenceBrand AmbassadorFeatured in nationwide campaigns (billboards, online)#UnstoppableSiiRepresented on city murals across PolandGreat Place to Work 2018Part of large-scale employer branding campaignSii CalendarSelected company representative (2019–2020)11. What's next?Get In TouchWhether you have a question, want to discuss a project, or just want to say hi - my inbox is always open.Say HelloPrefer to keep a copy of my experience?Save as PDFDesigned and built in deep vastness of the space.© 2026 Remigiusz Bednarczyk. All rights reserved.•Privacy PolicyI use Google Analytics to see which parts of this portfolio get read. Nothing is stored until you agree, and the site works the same either way. Read the privacy policyDeclineAccept @media print { @page { size: A4; margin: 12mm 15mm; } body { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; } } Remigiusz BednarczykTest Manager+48 530 333 243hello@remigiuszbednarczyk.comlinkedin.com/in/rembednarczykremigiuszbednarczyk.comPolandScan for LinkedInSummaryQuality Engineering Lead and Test Manager with extensive experience in regulated environments, particularly in the pharmaceutical sector (GxP). Specialized in designing testing strategies, managing cross-functional QA teams, and driving digital transformation in testing processes. Proven track record of combining technical rigor with a deep understanding of business and compliance requirements to deliver predictable, high-quality software solutions.Core Competencies & SkillsTest Management: Test Strategy & Planning, Risk-Based Testing, Defect Management, QA Process Design, GxP / CSV Compliance, Audit Preparation.Delivery & Leadership: Test Leadership, Stakeholder Management, SAFe / Agile Delivery, ITIL, AgilePM, Quality Governance at Scale.Technical & Data Background: API Testing, SQL / Data Validation, ETL & Data Pipelines, Frontend Testing, CI/CD Awareness, AI-assisted Testing.Methodologies: Agile / Scrum, Waterfall, V-Model, Shift-Left Testing.Tools & Technologies: Jira & Xray, HP ALM / Micro Focus, TraceLink, Postman, noSQL / MongoDB.Professional ExperienceTest Manager | Sii Poland2021 - PresentLeading quality engineering and testing strategy across regulated pharmaceutical projects while also contributing to internal consulting, discovery phases, and QA offerings within the Sii Testing Competency Center.Contributed to discovery phases for new projects by assessing testing maturity, risks, and delivery models.Supported pre-sales activities, including solution design, testing strategy proposals, and estimation.Participated in the creation and evolution of testing offerings within the Sii Testing Competency Center.Took part in focus groups and internal initiatives shaping quality engineering practices across the organization.Test Manager / GxP Projects2021 - PresentManaged testing teams across multiple concurrent GxP-regulated projects within a distributed international environment, collaborating daily with global cross-functional stakeholders (USA, Switzerland, UK, Malaysia).Ensured predictable delivery by owning end-to-end test management, including defining and approving Test Strategies and Test Plans aligned with business goals, regulatory requirements, and project constraints.Ensured testing compliance within a validated GxP/CSV environment, taking full accountability for testing activities, validation alignment, and formal documentation (RTMs, Release Test Plans, Test Reports).Established QA processes from scratch by conducting discovery phases, assessing existing workflows, and implementing governance, entry/exit criteria, and best practices.Successfully delivered and rolled out a digitalized testing and documentation process used across regulated IRT workflows, transitioning from paper-based to digital test documentation (Jira with Xray).Enabled regulatory compliance of the pharmaceutical supply chain by leading the implementation of the EU Module in TraceLink.Acted as Validation Lead, with decision authority over validation approach, documentation scope, and lifecycle coverage.Implemented time-optimizing solutions, such as Unscripted Testing and alternative automation approaches, to increase team efficiency under tight timelines.Resolved conflicts between delivery timelines, quality expectations, and compliance requirements by aligning multiple stakeholders across business, QA, and project management.Senior Test & Analysis Engineer / Acxiom | Sii Poland2018 - 2021Conducted comprehensive API, GUI, and web services testing to ensure robust application functionality and seamless integration.Led cloud testing initiatives across AWS, HDFS, Hue, Kafka, Spark, Qubole, and S3, ensuring data integrity within Data Warehouses and Data Lakes.Analyzed business requirements to prepare detailed test documentation, including comprehensive test plans and test cases.Implemented and executed both manual and automated tests, continuously improving the test framework and introducing innovative testing strategies.Enhanced the regression test suite and integrated it into the Continuous Integration (CI) pipeline to accelerate delivery cycles.Validated complex data structures and performed extensive database testing using relational (Oracle, MSSQL, MySQL) and non-relational (NoSQL, MongoDB, Hadoop) databases.Collaborated within cross-functional, international teams (USA, UK, Poland) using UNIX/Linux environments and Git/SVN version control systems.Test & Analysis Engineer / Acxiom | Sii Poland2017 - 2018Performed manual and automated testing for Data Warehouses and web services, ensuring data accuracy and system reliability.Created and maintained comprehensive test documentation, including test plans and test cases based on business requirements.Contributed to the continuous improvement of the test framework and integrated regression test suites into the CI pipeline.Executed database testing across relational (Oracle, MSSQL, MySQL) and non-relational (NoSQL, MongoDB, Hadoop) environments.Worked effectively within international, cross-functional teams utilizing UNIX/Linux systems and Git/SVN version control.Application Tester / Simple S.A. (Bazus) | Simple S.A.2014 - 2017Tested the Bazus ERP application dedicated to higher education institutions, ensuring system reliability across various modules and customer production environments.Actively participated in an Agile (Scrum) development team, contributing to release planning, test estimation, and SLA-driven backlog management.Performed end-to-end system, module, and operational testing, applying techniques like equivalence partitioning and boundary value analysis.Conducted build verification tests (BVT) and managed build releases via internal deployment systems to Git repositories within a Continuous Integration (CI) pipeline.Created and maintained manual test cases and automated testware using Selenium IDE, while comprehensively analyzing functional requirements.Developed and administered technical documentation using single-source publishing tools, and conducted internal training sessions for team members.Community & LeadershipVice President of the Polish Testing Board (SJSI).Conference Host & Speaker at major IT events including TestWarez and Na Podbój IT.Trainer & Mentor for 500+ software testers, specializing in QA practices and ISTQB preparation.Lead Technical Assessor responsible for evaluating testing professionals from Junior to Test Manager level.Author of technical articles on software testing and quality assurance practices.Recognition & Brand PresenceLeague of Honor – The Star (Sii Poland, 2023): Highest distinction awarded to top contributors shaping company growth and strategic direction.Top Gun – Leadership Award (Sii Poland, 2022): Recognized as a role model and impactful leader in the organization.Sii Star – Employee of the Year (Sii Poland, 2022 & 2018): Awarded for outstanding performance and measurable impact.Brand Ambassador & Representative: Featured in nationwide campaigns, city murals (#UnstoppableSii), Great Place to Work 2018, and Sii Calendar (2019-2020).Certifications & CredentialsCore certificationsISTQB Accredited Trainer - CTFL 4.0 + Agile Tester Accreditation ExtensionSJSI (Polish Testing Board)ID: ISTQB/ATP/61/2023/40Nov 2023ISTQB Certified Tester Foundation Level Agile TesterSJSI (Polish Testing Board)ID: FLAT-2023-00628-SJSINov 2023ISTQB Certified Tester Advanced Level Test ManagerGASQID: 10960-1Mar 2021ISTQB Certified Tester Advanced Level Technical Test AnalystGASQID: 10960-3Aug 2018ISTQB Certified Tester Foundation LevelSJSI (Polish Testing Board)ID: 10262/FLCT/2018Aug 2018Certified SAFe® 6 AgilistSAFe by Scaled Agile, Inc.Jun 2023AgilePM® FoundationAPMG InternationalID: 2000913818 / 04303830-01-FEDMOct 2019AI & Emerging Tech CertificationsAI_devs 3 AgentsAI_devsID: 88fd734b-0390-4c14-81ae-a69e400f1dd1Dec 2024Fundamentals of Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning for IT Specialists and ManagersFUTURE SKILLS INSTITUTENov 2025Additional TrainingReasoning About Asynchronous JavaScriptPluralsightID: REP ID 4127Aug 2019Javascript: Getting StartedPluralsightID: REP ID 4127Jul 2019Szkolenie TrenerskieBarbara Smoczyńska Usługi RozwojoweJun 2019How Git WorksPluralsightID: REP ID 4127May 2019Continuous Integration and Continuous Delivery: The Big PicturePluralsightID: REP ID 4127May 2019Applying the Lambda Architecture with Spark, Kafka, and CassandraPluralsightID: REP ID 4127Jan 2019Introduction to MongoDBPluralsightID: REP ID 4127Dec 2018Take Control of Your Big Data with HUE in Cloudera CDHPluralsightID: REP ID 